  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔗 Create User List Metadata",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Generate Access Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "const accessToken = jsonData.access_token;",
                  "",
                  "pm.environment.set(\"access_token\", accessToken);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "packages": {},
                "requests": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{client_secret}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{client_id}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "transactionId",
                "value": "{{$guid}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "institutionId",
                "value": "{{institution_id}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "client_credentials",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apigee_base_url}}/oauth2/v1/token",
              "host": [
                "{{apigee_base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "oauth2",
                "v1",
                "token"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Create User List Metadata",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "transactionId",
                "value": "{{$guid}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"userLists\": [\n        {\n            \"fileMetadata\": {\n                \"userlistFileName\": \"{{user_list_file_name}}\",\n                \"userlistName\": \"{{user_list_name}}\",\n                \"userlistOperation\": \"{{user_list_operation}}\"\n            }\n        }\n    ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{apigee_base_url}}/v1/userlists",
              "host": [
                "{{apigee_base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "userlists"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Create or update user list metadata for an uploaded SFTP file. Minimum body: `userlistFileName`, `userlistName`, and `userlistOperation`.\n\nSet `user_list_operation` in the environment to one of the following values:\n\n- **CREATE**: Create a new user list using data from the uploaded SFTP file.\n- **REPLACE**: Replace all users in an existing user list with the data from the uploaded SFTP file.\n- **ADD**: Add users from the uploaded SFTP file to an existing user list.\n- **REMOVE**: Remove users specified in the uploaded SFTP file from an existing user list.\n- **CREATE_OR_REPLACE**: Create a new user list if it does not exist; otherwise, replace the existing user list with the contents of the uploaded SFTP file.\n- **CREATE_OR_ADD**: Create a new user list if it does not exist; otherwise, add users from the uploaded SFTP file to the existing user list.\n\n```\nPOST /v1/userlists\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "## 🔄 Create User List Metadata Flow\n\n| **Step** | Request Name | **Description** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Generate Access Token | Obtain an access token using client credentials to authorize API requests. |\n| 2 | Create User List Metadata | Create or update user list metadata. Set `user_list_operation` to one of the following values:  <br>• **CREATE**: Create a new user list using data from the uploaded SFTP file.  <br>• **REPLACE**: Replace all users in an existing user list with the data from the uploaded SFTP file.  <br>• **ADD**: Add users from the uploaded SFTP file to an existing user list.  <br>• **REMOVE**: Remove users specified in the uploaded SFTP file from an existing user list.  <br>• **CREATE_OR_REPLACE**: Create a new user list if it does not exist; otherwise, replace the existing user list with the contents of the uploaded SFTP file.  <br>• **CREATE_OR_ADD**: Create a new user list if it does not exist; otherwise, add users from the uploaded SFTP file to the existing user list. |",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {},
            "exec": [
              "const requiredVars = [",
              "    \"user_list_operation\",",
              "    \"user_list_name\"",
              "];",
              "",
              "const missingVars = requiredVars.filter(varName => !pm.environment.get(varName));",
              "",
              "if (missingVars.length > 0) {",
              "    throw new Error(",
              "        `Missing required environment variables: ${missingVars.join(\", \")}. Please set them in the active environment before running requests.`",
              "    );",
              "}",
              "",
              "const fiId = pm.environment.get('institution_id');",
              "const fileLabel = pm.environment.get('user_list_file_label') || 'PostmanUserList';",
              "const pad = (n) => String(n).padStart(2, '0');",
              "const now = new Date();",
              "const timestamp = `${now.getFullYear()}${pad(now.getMonth() + 1)}${pad(now.getDate())}${pad(now.getHours())}${pad(now.getMinutes())}${pad(now.getSeconds())}`;",
              "const fileName = `FI${fiId}_${fileLabel}_${timestamp}.csv`;",
              "",
              "pm.environment.set('user_list_file_name', fileName);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
