      ],
      "description": "## 🔄 Get User List Details Flow\n\n| **Step** | Request Name | **Description** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Generate Access Token | Obtain an access token using client credentials to authorize API requests. |\n| 2a | \\[Option 1\\] Get User List Details - fileStatus | Retrieve the processing status of the uploaded file, including job status, user counts, and related processing messages. |\n| 2b | \\[Option 2\\] Get User List Details - fileErrorReport | Retrieve the error report for the uploaded file or return a message indicating its availability status. |",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "packages": {},
            "requests": {},
            "exec": [
              "const userListFileName = pm.environment.get('user_list_file_name');",
              "",
              "if (!userListFileName || userListFileName === '') {",
              "    throw new Error(",
              "        `Missing required environment variable: user_list_file_name. Please set it in the active environment before running request.`",
              "    );",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
